# What `docker build` (deploy/Dockerfile) leaves out of the context: builds,
# caches and installs, each of which the image makes again, and the parts
# of the repository the image never reads (the app, the Worker, the demo,
# the docs but the legal pages the web build renders and the contract
# ClaxBot's prompt carries).
.git
target
**/target
**/node_modules
bazel-*
web/dist/*
!web/dist/.gitkeep
web/dist-extension/*
!web/dist-extension/.gitkeep
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
web/e2e
web/perf
apps
crates/clax-worker
demo
design
local
deploy/k8s
docs/*
!docs/legal
!docs/contract.md
.wrangler
